    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0LD_1LC1RA_0RD0LC_1RA1RA p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0LD_1LC1RA_0RD0LC_1RA1RA p j' E).
    + lia.
