    + reflexivity.
    + reflexivity.
    + exact (gso_1RB0LD_1RC0LA_1LA1RB_0RB0LD p j' E).
    + exact (geo_1RB0LD_1RC0LA_1LA1RB_0RB0LD p j' E).
    + lia.
